  "article": {
    "images": [],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Flying can be scary for many people. To help passengers stay "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", an airport in Mexico has a new team of workers. They are not "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pilots",
            "ref": "v-pilot"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "guards",
            "ref": "v-guard"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", but friendly, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " dogs!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The airport recently started this project. The goal is to help passengers feel less stressed and more relaxed "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their flights. The team has many cute dogs, such as Marshall, a fluffy Samoyed "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Samoyed",
            "zh": "萨摩耶"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and Delta, a small Dachshund "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Dachshund",
            "zh": "腊肠犬"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". There is also a Labrador "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Labrador",
            "zh": "拉布拉多"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and a French bulldog "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "French bulldog",
            "zh": "法国斗牛犬"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "These dogs "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the airport with their handlers "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "handlers",
            "zh": "训犬师"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " people who are waiting to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "board",
            "ref": "v-board"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their planes. Passengers are "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to pet the dogs or give them a cuddle "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "cuddle",
            "zh": "拥抱"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “We already consider them as co-workers "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "co-workers",
            "zh": "同事"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” said a handler. “We "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them, and they help people to relieve stress "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "relieve stress",
            "zh": "缓解压力"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and calm down a little bit.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The dogs are still "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " puppies, so they only work for about an hour at a time. The airport is now looking at how "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the program has been. If it goes well, more "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "furry",
            "ref": "v-furry"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " helpers may appear at other airports in Mexico. Next time you travel to the country, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a wagging tail!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
